{"id": "1536630034125557830", "channel_id": "1536630034125557830", "author_id": "183782216353054720", "author_name": "omnichromia", "content": "I narrowed it down with some testing.\n\nVery specifically, Mute Jukebox sees the TEMPORARY Singularity Beacon—the one given to a card as it's played and removed when it resolves—as a copiable value.\n\nSince this special Beacon affix doesn't prevent a card from triggering Dimension Shuttle, the copies that now have Beacon (only by means of Jukebox) can get Beacon *again,* and can keep stacking it if they keep triggering Jukebox.\n\nMute Jukebox doesn't see the *real* Singularity Beacon as copiable (see video 4), only the *temporary* version of it.\n\nBonus note: I know this \"temporary\" Beacon isn't the *real* Singularity Beacon because Arachne's OverExalt can't find it! (See video 3 where only 1 Biomimicry was created)", "timestamp": "2026-08-11T06:59:09.341000+00:00", "thread_id": "1536630034125557830", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-11T07:03:18.683000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1536630036013129828", "filename": "screen-20260810-223537-1786426511347.mp42.mp4", "content_type": "video/mp4", "size": 6772936, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1536630034125557830/1536630036013129828/screen-20260810-223537-1786426511347.mp42.mp4?ex=6a7c19bd&is=6a7ac83d&hm=c8b30a858c918b3ae3d015e21bdb0ba43f8555711f64138e8dd8164526f11c0e&"}, {"id": "1536630037434867802", "filename": "screen-20260810-230138-1786427994569.mp4", "content_type": "video/mp4", "size": 33329663, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1536630034125557830/1536630037434867802/screen-20260810-230138-1786427994569.mp4?ex=6a7c19be&is=6a7ac83e&hm=78e4bc1c4ac30fab5dca5c9ca576af7818a623d8aa61a78693f6127b066e3244&"}, {"id": "1536630039460978728", "filename": "screen-20260810-232253-1786429323220.mp4", "content_type": "video/mp4", "size": 16644394, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1536630034125557830/1536630039460978728/screen-20260810-232253-1786429323220.mp4?ex=6a7c19be&is=6a7ac83e&hm=3516d193bf7231ed2afe98e53b53c87226494ed0255e7e9b584c6d5fddecaf4c&"}, {"id": "1536630040526192690", "filename": "screen-20260810-234036-1786430416506.mp4", "content_type": "video/mp4", "size": 6566671, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1536630034125557830/1536630040526192690/screen-20260810-234036-1786430416506.mp4?ex=6a7c19be&is=6a7ac83e&hm=6c2fcd7e300b6ac827ea9a11872e03577518a4a99aaf2002fb2ad867705d27c6&"}], "thread_title": "(AR) Mute Jukebox creates copies with Singularity Beacon", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1181168103141416960", "1361168893200044183"], "is_thread_starter": true}
